  "description": "Reads a DeepSharp pipeline's rows out of an Apache Parquet file: .ReadParquet(path) in the chain, read.parquet in a pipeline file, replayed like any other file the pipeline reads. The file says what each of its columns holds, and the proposal of kinds takes what it says; every value is handed over as the text the pipeline reads, one way for every typed source, and a column of lists, groups or raw bytes is refused by name rather than flattened by guesswork.",
